cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Se você usar este software, cite-o conforme abaixo."
type: software
title: "gh-satd-miner: resilient multi-artifact mining for GitHub repositories"
abstract: >-
  Mining infrastructure for empirical studies of self-admitted technical
  debt in GitHub repositories. It collects lexicon matches from code
  comments, commit messages, issue bodies, and pull-request bodies. The
  pipeline supports token rotation, batched GitHub Search API queries,
  incremental checkpoints, recovery from transient failures, and repository
  name canonicalization. It accompanies UBWSet, a code-comment dataset of
  ugly-but-it-works admissions.
